@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@token = paste-admin-access-token
@order = ORD-261020-00001

### Orders waiting to be picked (with shelf locations)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/fulfilment/queue
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Order detail (admin sees cost + margin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders/{{order}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Customer pays the rest in cash at the counter
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders/{{order}}/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "method": "CASH", "amountCents": 100000 }

### Pack (all three checks must be true)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders/{{order}}/pack
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "checks": { "correctParts": true, "noDamage": true, "brandedPackaging": true } }

### Click & collect: ready → handed over
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders/{{order}}/ready-for-collection
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders/{{order}}/handover
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Label / packing slip (REST Client shows the PDF; use the save icon to open it)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders/{{order}}/label.pdf
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
